cross join (values
    ('Neon shop sign', 'Look for glowing tubes of colored neon gas that light up after dark, often spelling out shop names or simple words in smooth, curved letters.', 'Capture a glowing neon sign displaying business name or advertisement. Frame must show the neon tubes lit up with characteristic bright colored light against a darker background.', 'common'::public.item_rarity, 'Neon tubes can last 8-15 years of continuous operation without dimming, outlasting most other signage by decades.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/fb37fa32060b94ec.jpg', 0),
    ('Vintage storefront awning', 'Find a striped or solid fabric canopy extending from above the shop entrance, typically faded with age and supported by metal brackets or poles.', 'Frame a traditional fabric or metal awning extending over a shop entrance. Show the aged, faded, or classic design with visible wear or patina characteristic of older establishments.', 'uncommon'::public.item_rarity, 'Awning fabric can reduce storefront heat by up to 25%, lowering cooling costs significantly in urban retail spaces.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/faf7931459e545db.jpg', 1),
    ('Painted business name on brick', 'Search for lettering or a business name painted directly onto exposed brick walls, often large and weathered from years of sun and rain exposure.', 'Photograph painted lettering or business name directly on a brick wall surface. The text must be clearly visible and painted onto the red or clay-colored brick facade.', 'common'::public.item_rarity, 'Hand-painted brick signs can remain legible for 50+ years; the paint actually bonds chemically with aged mortar.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/5d6348c62367732c.jpg', 2),
    ('Glass storefront window display', 'Look at the large glass panes at street level where shops arrange products and decorations to attract passersby—notice the arrangement and reflections.', 'Capture a shop''s glass storefront window showing merchandise or displays inside. Frame the transparent glass panes with visible contents or reflections displayed behind the glass.', 'common'::public.item_rarity, 'Plate glass for storefronts was revolutionary when invented; before 1905, most shops had small diamond-paned windows.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/f41cfcfc6bc08088.jpg', 3),
    ('Wooden shop door frame', 'Find the wooden border surrounding a shop''s entrance door, which may be painted, stained, or showing natural wood grain with wear marks and details.', 'Show a wooden frame surrounding a shop entrance door. Frame the door structure, wooden surround, and entrance threshold with visible wood construction details.', 'common'::public.item_rarity, 'Historic wooden frames often warp predictably—craftsmen account for this by slightly offsetting the mortise joints.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/526e11c2bf2cbed7.jpg', 4),
    ('Metal roller shutter with graffiti', 'Look for a corrugated metal gate that rolls up and down, typically covered with layers of colorful street art, tags, and markings.', 'Photograph a rolled-down metal security shutter on a shop front. The shutter surface must display visible graffiti markings or street art tags.', 'common'::public.item_rarity, 'Roller shutters became standard in cities after 1980s; they reduce property damage losses by up to 40%.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/1104f785eb7ed689.jpg', 5),
    ('Hand-painted window lettering', 'Search for words or designs painted directly onto storefront windows in various styles, from elegant script to bold block letters, often in gold or white.', 'Capture text or lettering hand-painted directly on a shop window. Show the painted letters on glass with visible brushwork or artistic application style.', 'uncommon'::public.item_rarity, 'Sign painters traditionally used gold leaf, which reflects light differently than paint and costs 10x more per square inch.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/9290f02e2bb43852.jpg', 6),
    ('Illuminated corner store sign', 'Look for a lit-up sign positioned at the corner of a building, visible from multiple directions, usually with the shop''s name brightly displayed.', 'Frame a glowing or backlit sign identifying a corner store location. The sign must be illuminated and positioned at a building corner, clearly visible from the street.', 'common'::public.item_rarity, 'Corner locations command 20-40% higher rent because foot traffic naturally increases at intersections.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/46dfefcb97800b84.jpg', 7),
    ('Antique barber pole', 'Find the iconic red, white, and blue striped cylinder spinning outside a barber shop, a classic symbol that''s instantly recognizable.', 'Photograph the classic red, white, and blue rotating or stationary spiral barber pole. Show the cylindrical striped pole mounted at a barber shop entrance.', 'rare'::public.item_rarity, 'The red-white-blue spiral originated from bloodletting: red for blood, white for bandages, blue for veins.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/63d58b46ac979984.jpg', 8),
    ('Weathered cafe entrance', 'Look for a cafe doorway showing signs of age like faded paint, worn wooden frames, and character marks that reveal years of daily use and exposure.', 'Capture a cafe or coffee shop entrance showing visible age, wear, or weathering. Frame the doorway and facade with evidence of time-worn surfaces, faded paint, or aged materials.', 'common'::public.item_rarity, 'Patina from weathering actually protects underlying materials; completely cleaned historic storefronts often deteriorate faster.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/07e786e1297075e7.jpg', 9),
    ('Arched doorway with business name', 'Find an entrance with a curved arch above it that displays the business name, commonly seen in older buildings with classic architectural style.', 'Frame an arched entrance doorway to a shop with the business name visible above or on the arch. Show the curved architectural feature with legible business identification.', 'uncommon'::public.item_rarity, 'Arched entries distribute weight better than rectangular ones, allowing heavier signage and decorative elements above.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/bcb7558d95f52abd.jpg', 10),
    ('Corrugated metal storefront', 'Look for a shop front made of wavy or ridged sheet metal, often rustic-looking and common on older or industrial-style commercial buildings.', 'Photograph a shop facade covered in corrugated metal sheets or siding. Show the wavy metal paneling visible across the storefront surface with characteristic ridged texture.', 'uncommon'::public.item_rarity, 'Corrugated metal absorbs sound, making it 40% more effective at noise reduction than flat metal sheets.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/e63b8af73f14fa62.jpg', 11),
    ('Decorative tile around shop entrance', 'Search for colorful or patterned tiles framing the doorway or surrounding the entrance area, adding visual interest and protecting against wear.', 'Capture ornamental or decorative tiles framing a shop doorway or entrance area. Show the colored, patterned, or embellished tile work surrounding the entry threshold.', 'uncommon'::public.item_rarity, 'Victorian tilework around storefronts is nearly indestructible; examples from the 1890s still have visible glaze.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/0ec6b4185b262393.jpg', 12),
    ('Hanging commercial street sign', 'Look for a sign suspended from a bracket or chain above the sidewalk, hanging perpendicular to the storefront and visible to people walking by.', 'Frame a sign suspended from above by chains, brackets, or poles. Show the business identification hanging perpendicular to the building facade over the storefront.', 'common'::public.item_rarity, 'Street-facing signs hang perpendicular to buildings because pedestrians see them from further away than window signage.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/5e1d1f0c82b7cbd6.jpg', 13),
    ('Reflective store window at night', 'Photograph a shop window after dark where interior lights and street reflections create interesting patterns and glowing effects on the glass.', 'Photograph a shop window at night showing reflections of street lights, neon, or surroundings. Capture the glass storefront with visible reflected light and nighttime illumination.', 'common'::public.item_rarity, 'Night reflections in storefront glass come from interior lighting overpowering ambient light, a phenomenon called contrast inversion.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/642285b0b7f4731b.jpg', 14),
    ('Faded historical business mural', 'Find a large painted image or advertisement covering a wall that''s decades old, where colors have faded and details blur but the subject is still visible.', 'Show a large painted business advertisement or mural on a building wall that appears aged and faded. Capture the original painted artwork with visible deterioration and color fading over time.', 'uncommon'::public.item_rarity, 'Faded murals often used cheaper pigments; expensive pigments (like lapis) remain vibrant for centuries.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/f09f5d9ad4d5f1b2.jpg', 15),
    ('Stacked shop signs on pole', 'Look for multiple business signs mounted vertically on a single pole or post, often pointing in different directions and showing various styles and ages.', 'Frame multiple business signs stacked vertically on a single pole or post. Show overlapping signs with different names, each mounted one above the other along the same support structure.', 'uncommon'::public.item_rarity, 'Stacking multiple signs reduces wind load stress by 30% compared to one large sign, extending pole lifespan.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/f464bc2ba15ee30d.jpg', 16),
